    MAP --> L
    I --> B
    B --> OUT --> UI
    I --> XLSX

    NOTE["Scope: AREA + factual pod counts only.<br/>No alerts / severity / downstream / outage verdict.<br/>UNKNOWN when a pod is not mapped (never guessed)."]:::note
    OUT -.-> NOTE

